{"name":"Cherri, The Last Petal","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"","alignment":"Neutral Good","hitDice":"5","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"16","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"95","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"8","dexPoints":"12","conPoints":"10","intPoints":"14","wisPoints":"20","chaPoints":"16","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"30","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"11","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":true,"legendariesDescription":"","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Spellcasting","desc":"Cherri is a 9th-level Druid of Treefell. Her spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 17, +8 to hit with spell attacks). It has the following druid spells prepared:\nCantrips (at will): Druidcraft, Resistance, Thorn Whip\n1st Level (2 slots): Cure Wounds\n2nd Level (2 slots): Flame Blade, Enhance Ability\n3rd Level (2 slots): Dispel Magic, Plant Growth\n4th Level (1 slot): Elemental Bane \n??? Level (1 slot): **Hidden Stem**"}],"actions":[{"name":"Quarterstaff Wallop","desc":"Cherri brandishes a quarterstaff that Mei bestowed upon her during their travels together. Utilizing her weapon, she strikes an enemy with her might, (or as best as she can try to.)\n(+7) to hit, 5 ft., single target."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[{"name":"!|! The Last Resort: Hidden Stem","desc":"**[隐藏式把立] !|!**\nCherri clasps her hands together, as an aura of leaves and druidic energy envelop the area surrounding her. This will be Cherri's only action she performs this turn. \nAfter spending one full turn charging, Cherri would scream out and force the Druidic energy she had been gathering outward. \n(+9, +12 to enemies under 50% HP), 50 ft., up to 3 targets. \nFrom the earth, roots pierce into three victims, dealing [3d12] piercing damage to each. Against one enemy, this is increased to [5d10] piercing damage. \n!! To enemies under 50% HP, this attack instead deals [5d10] piercing damage. Against one enemy, this is increased to [6d12] piercing damage.\nThe victim must roll a DC 19 CON Save, or be inflicted with **Druidic Grasp** for one turn.\n**Druidic Grasp** halts the enemy's movement and restricts them to either one use of a Bonus Action, or an Action."}],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[{"name":"animal Handling","stat":"wis"},{"name":"medicine","stat":"wis"},{"name":"nature","stat":"int"}],"damagetypes":[{"name":"fire","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Elvish","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":1,"damage":[]}